<title>USA: Raytheon to pay down $7 bln debt over 7 yrs.</title>
<headline>Raytheon to pay down $7 bln debt over 7 yrs.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Raytheon Co Chief Financial Officer Peter D'Angelo said Friday the company's acquisition of Hughes Electronics Corp's defense assets will raise Raytheon's debt to around $11 billion.</p>
<p>Raytheon is adding $4.4 billion of debt in the deal, he said.</p>
<p>The company expects to pay down about $7 billion of debt over a seven-year period, he said.</p>
<p>&quot;Our projections indicate that over a seven-year period we'll be able to pay down...approximately $7 billion in debt,&quot; D'Angelo told reporters during a telephone conference call.</p>
</text>
